# gr-L1-market-analysis-quality-gate — Python-Hybrid Colang Implementation
# Layer: L1 — fires at L1-vision-market-analyzer-evaluator's post_execution
# Validates L1-vision-market-analyzer's RESULTANT output (not the evaluator's own bookkeeping)
# Deterministic checks via actions.py + LLM for semantic checks

define flow check output market analysis quality gate
  """Deterministic schema/rubric check (across all five dimensions: competitor_matrix,
  market_sizing, industry_trends, customer_insights, pricing_benchmarks, swot) on the
  resultant content, then LLM semantic check."""
  $has_issues = execute check_market_analysis_quality_gate(output=$bot_message, generator_output=$generator_output)

  if $has_issues
    bot block market analysis quality gate violation
    stop

  $result = execute self_check_output

  if not $result
    bot block market analysis quality gate violation
    stop

define bot block market analysis quality gate violation
  "L1-vision-market-analyzer's resultant output (post-evaluation) failed its quality gate: schema violation, incomplete citation coverage across competitor/market-sizing/industry-trends/customer-insights/pricing-benchmarks entries, or a fabricated figure, per L1-vision-market-analyzer/evaluation.md's rubric. The workflow cannot proceed to L1-vision-statement-generator with non-conformant content. Retrying."
